DreamShell

gl/LensModel.kt follows the lens model of the Google Cardboard SDK
(https://github.com/googlevr/cardboard: sdk/lens_distortion.cc,
sdk/polynomial_radial_distortion.cc), Apache License 2.0, as ported to C# by
CardboardXR (https://github.com/brenpoly/CardboardXR), Apache License 2.0.
The alignment line follows the Cardboard SDK's alignment marker.

The Daydream controller packet layout follows daydream-controller.js
(https://github.com/mrdoob/daydream-controller.js). The pairing requirement and the
default pointing axis follow daydream2hid (https://github.com/ryukoposting/daydream2hid).

Daydream View distortion coefficients as given in
https://github.com/googlevr/cardboard/issues/17.
